00:03:51.198 --> 00:03:54.310
MARK MANDEL: Yeah, but now that
means if you want to use Java

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:58.800
8, basically just add Java 8
line to your appengine-web.xml

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.430
