Realtime Database,

00:25:45.170 --> 00:25:46.340
so that my be a
driving factor, too.

00:25:46.340 --> 00:25:47.506
ALEX DUFETEL: Yeah, exactly.

00:25:47.506 --> 00:25:51.890
So if you want to power
an offline-ready web app,

00:25:51.890 --> 00:25:53.724
then yes, definitely
use Cloud Firestore.

00:25:53.724 --> 00:25:55.640
MARK MANDEL: So I'm going
